 "statement": "Qualification-v2 strictly compiles the prepared collector and separate checker. Five scalar-polynomial controls include nonmonic, repeated, irreducible and full-field boundary roots. Six immutable synthetic matrices produce declared closed-rank gains0,1,1,0,1,1. The separate checker verifies complete independent left-kernel witnesses and every combination equation, and rejects four data corruptions. Both executables reject unknown/ambiguous arguments and output collisions;existing result bytes stay equal. No actual collection, residual curve roots or new curve points executed. Production code is compiled,not dynamically qualified on the P192 tangent fixture. Producer unsigned."
